<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telefonica Peru.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telefonica Peru.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst Jose M. Linares confirmed that he raised his rating on Telefonica del Peru SA to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- &quot;(Telefonica) has declined 7.3 percent versus 3.9 percent for the Peruvian market since the company reported third quarter results on October 29,&quot; Linares said in a research note.</p>
<p>&quot;The market appears to be confused.  We believe investors are incorrectly focusing on declines in traffic per line and overlooking third quarter results, which were in line with our estimate and were strong.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The subsequent price decline provides investors with a good entry point.&quot;</p>
</text>
